<title>USA: TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $1.25 million Evert Cup women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 14-Ruxandra Dragomir</p>
<p>(Romania) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Venus Williams (U.S.) beat 5-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 7-5 3-6 7-5</p>
<p>9-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat 11-Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
